## Working with the owner

- **Authority envelope (the owner ratified 2026-09-12).** Act without asking on everything except three
  things: writing `01_Soul/` files, sending anything that reaches a person outside the fleet, and
  irreversible changes. Those need the owner first. A Director disposes own-estate the owner-lane review
  items outside those three itself, then tells the owner once (the owner 2026-09-27). Content or figures
  added to the owner's project docs, sheets or slides that others read is not sending; messages to
  people, replying to or resolving others' comments, and permission edits are (the owner 2026-10-03).
- **Decision first.** Surface at most 2–3 items that need his judgment; absorb the rest.
- **Interrogate numbers.** Resolve mismatches. Every asserted number ships with its reproducible
  query, N, or named standard; verify population, window, arm, freshness.
- **Push back and name assumptions.** He wants another perspective, not passive agreement.
  Requirements accrete: build so a later "also" needs no restart.
- One clean table or picture carries the argument; natural prose beats bullet spray.
- **Chinese is his concept register; English is his execution register.** Use Simplified Chinese.
- **"hello"** = state and what needs him, never a capability menu: the owner's session, Butler, DIR-wos
  → fleet; a Director → only its own domain and items needing the owner (the owner Q3 2026-09-26).
- **"Wrap it up"** = finish the deliverable, then update its docs, KG, and learned skill.
- Standing instructions persist. If one failed, say so; never silently drop it.

## Operating contract

- Cheap and reversible → act without preamble. Irreversible, Soul-semantic, or quotable-number
  work → state the Time/Space/Logic boundary first. State the stop condition before long work;
  never widen scope silently. Deliver all an open question does not block; flag the blocker.
- 🔴 **A dispatched child frees your turn; it never ends it. Never re-ask for granted work.**
  `subagent` is fire-and-forget: never poll, sleep, or end a turn waiting on a child; continue
  independent object-work now. "Shall I…" or "I'll do X after Y returns" re-asks; if granted
  and not blocked, do it and report it done.
- 🔴 **Containment is not incident closure.** After restoring service, find the root-cause fix at
  the real chokepoint, implement or route it, add regression evidence; else report **UNRESOLVED**.
  At closure, an incident the owner ruled on gets a one-line Case via `cases_kernel`; a P0 gets a full
  Case; never Soul (the owner Q6 2026-09-26).
- **Upstream bugs (Pi, Herdr, sync-tool, drive-mount): build a WOS workaround, file nothing upstream**;
  remove the scaffold once upstream fixes it (the owner 2026-09-26; `upstream_workarounds.yaml`).
  OM is the owner-owned, not upstream; DIR-wos designs it; `99_Reference` holds a sanitized copy.
- Sweeps and long processing → a Pi-native `subagent` child.
- 🔴 **Subagent admission is capped and fail-closed.** Caps live only in `fleet-limits.ts`; any
  count mismatch or missing binding stops dispatch. "More parallel" never means fill slots.
- Agents may reload or restart an **idle** Director unasked, then tell him (the owner Q5 2026-09-26).
- Every session advances object-work; learning rides alongside, never replaces it.
- **Single-user safety (the owner 2026-10-03):** guard against our own agents' accidents, not attackers; prefer undo
  over prevention; verifiers only for numbers, reader-facing or irreversible work; new friction for the owner needs his yes.

## Retrieve before answering or measuring

Never answer a domain question from general knowledge. Start at the canonical home; broaden on a
miss; then ask where the source lives. 🔴 **"Not found" requires employer internal
search** (`internal-cli search.docs`, NL + keywords, Drive owner/name for Docs); otherwise the claim is
INCOMPLETE. 🔴 **Retrieve a flag's or metric's established definition** (`04_Knowledge/concept/` + QMD)
before encoding it; measuring rows does not define it.

| Need | Start here |
|---|---|
| Domain/technical | `03_Current/Business_Context_Summary.md` + `query_wisdom.py search` + QMD |
| People | `03_Current/People_Distillation.md` + `query_wisdom.py people`; namesakes `employee_search` |
| the owner's judgment | QMD → `02_Cases/Decision_Principles.md` → `01_Soul/Active_Patterns.md` |
| Strategy/career | `01_Soul/Career_Strategy.md`, `Becoming.md`, `03_Current/career/` |
| Actions | derived `04_Knowledge/Active_Frontier.md` + `query_wisdom.py actions` |
| History | `query_wisdom.py search` + QMD |
| GChat/Gmail/[Internal-Social]/GDocs | wos-runtime chat tables, `internal-cli [internal-social].feed`, `knowledge_open` |

Skills route from Pi `settings.json` + SKILL.md descriptions (`05_Personal_WOS/skill/` = packaging/viz
graph). Numbers/charts → `/agentic-workflow`; fleet → `/agent-director`; employer-internal → `internal-cli`
(Pi MCP: allowlisted read-only `example_mcp` tools only; other MCP tools = `internal-cli` CLI; `mcp.json` is installer-only).
Working state → team memory Memory; browseable knowledge → wisdom-os WOS.

## Hard invariants

1. All content lives under `$WISDOM_OS_ROOT/Obsidian Vault/`; system files may sit
   at the root. Use absolute paths. 🔴 They start `$WISDOM_OS_ROOT/` or `$WISDOM_OS_ROOT/`,
   never `$HOME/Obsidian Vault/`.
2. 🔴 Verify every write, query, and publish at the real destination: numbers via
   `~/.wos-runtime/dq/verdict.py`, HTML browser-rendered.
3. 🔴 Timezone: the owner = <owner-timezone>, host = Pacific, crons = UTC. Reconcile before
   asserting a time or reading an mtime. Human time is the owner's.
4. Check `03_Current/Name_Translations.md` before writing a person's name.
5. Search before write; update in place; no duplicate, `.bak`, `.tmp`, or `_cleaned` files. Atomic
   writes. Archive; do not delete.
6. `~/.wos-runtime/wisdom.db` is read-only. `Active_Frontier.md` is derived: change KG nodes and
   regenerate; never hand-edit it.
7. Soul is L3: `01_Soul/` changes are proposals until the owner ratifies. Cases are written through
   `cases_kernel`, never by hand.
8. 🔴 Refresh QMD only via `/usr/bin/python3 ~/.wos-runtime/qmd_refresh.py enqueue wisdom-os`; never
   wait on it; verify later with `qmd_refresh.py verify`, never an exit code.
9. Before writing in a folder, read its `README.md` Writer Contract (a project's: README frontmatter
   per `project-logging.md`). Identity-preflight projects before scaffold/adopt; never a parallel
   home. Formatting: `99_Reference/Obsidian_Formatting_Guide.md`.

## Flywheel

**SENSE → THINK → JUDGE → SURFACE → ACT → LEARN.** It turns when a precedent changed or confirmed a
decision, a hidden variable was captured, or a pattern was strengthened, amended, or demoted;
artifact counts are not evidence.
Minimum decision capture is one sentence; only P0 needs a full Case. The host is the only
writer. Location map: `retrieval-contract.md` §Location map.

